      {
        "n": "TAFELMUSIK W/ FRANCESCO FUSARO - ARCHIVIO 19'40\"",
        "s": "2026-11-21T12:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-21T14:00:00Z",
        "d": "Francesco Fusaro, the man behind MFZ Records and classical music recording series 19'40'', brings a considered and varied selection of baroque, classical and contemporary music for a full two hours each month.\nFrom the host: \"As 19'40\" turns ten, Francesco Fusaro opens the archive of the (anti)classical record series he co-founded in 2016. A chronological trip through thirty numbered releases, from Debussy and Florence Price to Feldman, video game music and unlikely detours. Recorded for a day of celebrations in Milan.\"",
        "j": "FRANCESCO FUSARO",
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/francesco-fusaro/episodes/francesco-fusaro-21st-november-2026",
